---
import V5Layout from '../layouts/V5Layout.astro';
const title = "Projects - executed across continents, commodities and deposit styles | AiRE";
const description = "AiRE's exploration and consulting record presented as the output of one multi-evidence pipeline - a capability spectrum, a five-continent footprint map and a deployment ledger of flagship programs. Sanitized; no resource or grade claims.";
const bodyHtml = "\n\n<main>\n<section class=\"page-hero\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Projects</p>\n    <h1>Executed across continents, commodities and deposit styles.</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Decades of exploration and consulting on the ground - now compounded into one multi-evidence pipeline. Below: what the platform solves, the five-continent footprint behind it, and the flagship programs carried end to end. Details are sanitized; client, project and exact locations are withheld, and nothing here is a resource or grade claim.</p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ #5 \u00b7 Capability spectrum (opener) ============ -->\n<section class=\"section\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Capability spectrum</p>\n      <h2>What the platform solves, as one instrument readout.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Breadth at a glance - the commodities, deposit styles and evidence the CAGE-IN platform has carried to executed programs.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cap-spectrum\">\n      <div class=\"cap-tiles\">\n        <div class=\"cap-tile\"><b>5</b><span>continents</span></div>\n        <div class=\"cap-tile\"><b>10</b><span>commodities</span></div>\n        <div class=\"cap-tile\"><b>12</b><span>deposit styles</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"cap-cap\">commodities &amp; deposit styles proven on the CAGE-IN platform, across five continents of field experience</p>\n\n      <div class=\"spec-band\">\n        <p class=\"spec-label\">Commodity coverage</p>\n        <div class=\"cap-chips\">\n          <span class=\"cap-chip\">Nickel</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Copper-gold</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Gold</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Uranium-REE</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Iron ore</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Zinc-lead-silver</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Antimony</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Tin-coltan</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Graphite</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Copper-zinc</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"spec-band\">\n        <p class=\"spec-label\">Deposit style</p>\n        <div class=\"cap-chips\">\n          <span class=\"cap-chip\">Supergene laterite</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Porphyry</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Carlin-type &amp; epithermal</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Orogenic gold</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Paleoplacer</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Banded iron formation</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">SEDEX</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Carbonate replacement</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">VMS</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Rare-metal pegmatite</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Metamorphic flake graphite</span><span class=\"cap-chip\">Vein-hosted antimony</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"spec-band\">\n        <p class=\"spec-label\">Evidence the platform fuses</p>\n        <svg class=\"ev-fusion\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 392\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The platform fuses five evidence streams - spectral imagery, magnetics, gravity, radiometrics and geochemistry - into one ranked score.\">\n          <g class=\"ev-spokes\">\n            <line class=\"ev-spoke\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"300\"   y2=\"84\"/>\n            <line class=\"ev-spoke\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"400.8\" y2=\"157.2\"/>\n            <line class=\"ev-spoke\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"362.3\" y2=\"275.8\"/>\n            <line class=\"ev-spoke\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"237.7\" y2=\"275.8\"/>\n            <line class=\"ev-spoke\" x1=\"300\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"199.2\" y2=\"157.2\"/>\n          </g>\n          <circle class=\"ev-hub\" cx=\"300\" cy=\"190\" r=\"50\"/>\n          <text class=\"ev-hub-t1\" x=\"300\" y=\"185\">One ranked</text>\n          <text class=\"ev-hub-t2\" x=\"300\" y=\"202\">score</text>\n          <g class=\"ev-nodes\">\n            <circle class=\"ev-node\" cx=\"300\"   cy=\"84\"    r=\"9\" fill=\"#9a5630\"/>\n            <circle class=\"ev-node\" cx=\"400.8\" cy=\"157.2\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#a8623a\"/>\n            <circle class=\"ev-node\" cx=\"362.3\" cy=\"275.8\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#b5764d\"/>\n            <circle class=\"ev-node\" cx=\"237.7\" cy=\"275.8\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#c0855b\"/>\n            <circle class=\"ev-node\" cx=\"199.2\" cy=\"157.2\" r=\"9\" fill=\"#cb946b\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g class=\"ev-labels\">\n            <text class=\"ev-label\" x=\"300\"   y=\"26\"    text-anchor=\"middle\">Spectral</text>\n            <text class=\"ev-label\" x=\"456.0\" y=\"139.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Magnetics</text>\n            <text class=\"ev-label\" x=\"396.4\" y=\"322.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Gravity</text>\n            <text class=\"ev-label\" x=\"203.6\" y=\"322.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Radiometrics</text>\n            <text class=\"ev-label\" x=\"144.0\" y=\"139.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Geochem</text>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"cap-note\">Each program fuses up to <b>21 spectral indices</b> and <b>28 composites</b> across six satellite platforms with geophysics, geochemistry and drilling - scored by literature-calibrated deposit models. <span class=\"cap-dim\">Chips show the breadth of coverage carried to executed programs, not a resource or grade claim.</span></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ============ Global footprint (the world map) ============ -->\n<section class=\"section section-alt\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"section-head\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">Global footprint</p>\n      <h2>Five continents of ground behind the engine.</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Every deposit model the platform runs is calibrated against real exploration and consulting experience. This is where that experience was earned - dots are generalized to the map's scale; <b>ringed</b> markers are flagship CAGE-IN platform deployments. No client, project or precise location is shown.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wmap-wrap\">\n<svg class=\"wmap\" v